+
+Future prerequisites: independent SOURCE QA/security, meaningful current model/
+source controls and independent result acceptance; actual current image/bundle/
+source/dependency/admission receipts and exact finite root grant; actual raw
+phase/command/process/cleanup evidence and independent nonoperator review. No
+such experiment or grant exists in this SOURCE packet.
